/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (The passive scan identified a total of six findings, including four low-risk vulnerabilities and two informational observations. The detected issues mainly relate to missing HTTP security headers that improve browser security and help protect web applications against common attacks. No high-risk or critical vulnerabilities were identified during the assessment.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
